Vancouver (1 week near downtown/Transit)
- YWCA Hotel Vancouver (private rooms, excellent value and location)
- Samesun Vancouver (hostel; dorms and some privates; social, very budget-friendly)
- Barclay Hotel (West End; simple, typically among the cheaper private-room hotels)
- Moda Hotel (often competitive rates; central)
